    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25251" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Joppē</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Jŏpē</span></b> , ēs,
